[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    - The smallest integer \( k \) that satisfies this is \( k = 3 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    - Substitute \( k = 3 \) into \( x = 8k + 5 \):
