[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m To find the value of \( x \) in the given problem, we need to use the definition of the arithmetic mean. The arithmetic mean of a set of numbers is the sum of the numbers divided by the count of the numbers.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m Given the arithmetic mean of the numbers 7, 2, \( x \), and 10 is 9, we can set up the following equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \frac{7 + 2 + x + 10}{4} = 9
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m First, we will eliminate the fraction by multiplying both sides of the equation by 4:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 7 + 2 + x + 10 = 9 \times 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m Simplifying the right side of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 7 + 2 + x + 10 = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m Next, we will combine the constant terms on the left side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 19 + x = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m To isolate \( x \), we subtract 19 from both sides of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m x = 36 - 19
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m Simplifying the right side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m x = 17
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m Therefore, the value of \( x \) is \(\boxed{17}\).
