[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m To find the value of \( x \), we can use the definition of the arithmetic mean. The arithmetic mean of a set of numbers is the sum of the numbers divided by the count of the numbers. Here, the arithmetic mean of the numbers 7, 2, \( x \), and 10 is 9. Therefore, we can set up the following equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \frac{7 + 2 + x + 10}{4} = 9
