[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    - After finding the bag of 53 coins, the total number of coins is \( 175 + 53 = 228 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    - Since \( 228 \) is divisible by 8, this is a valid solution.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    - Therefore, the smallest number of coins you could have had before finding the bag of 53 coins is \( 175 \).
