[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m ### Step 2: Set Up the Equation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m According to the problem, the mean is \( 9 \). So, we set up the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \frac{7 + 2 + x + 10}{4} = 9
