[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m First, we calculate the total number of ways to choose 5 members from 14 (8 Republicans + 6 Democrats):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
