[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m Next, we need to subtract the number of ways to form subcommittees that are not in compliance with the given condition (i.e., the subcommittee is either all Republican or all Democratic). There is only one way to form a subcommittee of 5 Republicans:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
