[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m This is more than 200 coins. Therefore, the smallest possible value of \( x \) that satisfies all conditions is 29. The smallest number of coins you could have had before finding the bag of 53 coins is:
