[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m A Senate committee has 8 Republicans and 6 Democrats.  In how many ways can we form a subcommittee of 5 members that has at least one member from each party?
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{}.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m output:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m To form a subcommittee of 5 members that has at least one member from each party (Republicans and Democrats), we can use the principle of complementary counting. We will first calculate the total number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members from the 14 members (8 Republicans and 6 Democrats), and then subtract the number of subcommittees that are not of the required composition (either all Republicans or all Democrats).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 1. Calculate the total number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members from 14 members:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \binom{14}{5} = \frac{14!}{5!(14-5)!} = 2002
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 2. Calculate the number of subcommittees consisting only of Republicans (i.e., no Democrats):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \binom{8}{5} = \frac{8!}{5!(8-5)!} = 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 3. Calculate the number of subcommittees consisting only of Democrats (i.e., no Republicans):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \binom{6}{5} = \frac{6!}{5!(6-5)!} = 6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 4. The number of subcommittees that have at least one member from each party is the total number of subcommittees minus the number of subcommittees that are not of the required composition:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 2002 - \left(56 + 6\right) = 2002 - 62 = 1940
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m So, the number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members that has at least one member from each party is \(\boxed{1940}\).
