[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m To find the value of \( x \) given that the arithmetic mean of the numbers 7, 2, \( x \), and 10 is 9, we can follow these steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 1. Understand the definition of the arithmetic mean. The arithmetic mean of a set of numbers is the sum of the numbers divided by the count of the numbers.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 2. Set up the equation for the arithmetic mean of the numbers 7, 2, \( x \), and 10. The arithmetic mean is given as 9. So, we can write the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \frac{7 + 2 + x + 10}{4} = 9
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 3. To eliminate the denominator, multiply both sides of the equation by 4:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    7 + 2 + x + 10 = 9 \times 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    Simplify the right side of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    7 + 2 + x + 10 = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 4. Combine the constants on the left side of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    19 + x = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 5. Isolate \( x \) by subtracting 19 from both sides of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    x = 36 - 19
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    Simplify the right side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    x = 17
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m Thus, the value of \( x \) is \(\boxed{17}\).
