[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m To solve the problem, let's denote the initial number of coins in each of the six bags as \(x\). Since you found a bag with 53 coins and redistributed all the coins so that each of the eight bags contains the same number of coins, let's call this common number of coins in each bag \(y\). 
