[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 3. We are told that after redistributing the coins, all eight bags contain the same number of coins. Let this common number of coins be \( x \). Therefore, the total number of coins after redistribution is \( 8x \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 4. Since the coins are redistributed in such a way that each of the eight bags ends up with \( x \) coins, we have the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
