[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 5. We are also given that the total number of coins is more than 200:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    7n + 53 > 200
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m 6. Simplifying the inequality gives us:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    7n > 147 \implies n > 21
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2534317)[0m    Since \( n \) must be an integer, the smallest possible value for \( n \) is 22.
